<title>UK: Nomura sets warrants on NRI Global Blue Chip Index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on NRI Global Blue Chip Index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it had issued 400,000 American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the NRI Global 'Blue Chips' index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> ISS PRICE (CALL) $11.32		   STRIKE PRICE $160.36</p>
<p> ISS PRICE (PUT)  $ 7.30		   LISTING	LUX</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
